# Template for the VM file /opt/ecofate/tunnel.env (mode 0600, owner ecofate), read only by the
# `cloudflared` service, so the API and worker never hold the tunnel token. Copy the token from
# Cloudflare Zero Trust > Networks > Tunnels > your tunnel > "Install connector" (the long value
# after --token). deploy/deploy.sh refuses to deploy while it is missing or empty.
TUNNEL_TOKEN=
